
@startuml

title Actor Behavior

participant ActorManager as AM
participant DataManager as DM
participant JoystickManager as JM
participant EventManager as EM
participant BattleManager as BM
participant NetworkManager as NM
participant Server as S

AM -> AM:init()
note right
    1.初始化状态机
    2.生成武器，设置对应子弹类型
end note


group tick [dt: number] [tick方法，访问DM获取摇杆输入]
    AM -> DM :access JM by DM
    activate AM
        DM -> JM: get input
        JM --> DM: input: Vec2
    DM --> AM: input: Vec2
    AM -> EM: emit(event:ClientSync)
    deactivate AM
end

EM -> BM: emit(event:ClientSync)
BM -> NM: Instance
activate NM
    BM -> NM: sendMsg(MsgClientSync)
deactivate

group render [data: IActor] [根据数据渲染角色位置、方向和HP等]
    AM -> AM: renderPosition(data:IActor)
    AM -> AM: renderDirection(data:IActor)
    AM -> AM: renderHp(data:IActor)
end
@enduml